                <pb facs="1018" n="920" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg920"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Straus.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-12-29"><hi rendition="#italic">December 29,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Hay states that instructions have been issued to the consul at Smyrna to
                    report to Mr. Straus in regard to alleged violence to a consular officer. Mr.
                    Straus is directed to demand immediate protection if danger exists.]</p>
            </div>
